+            // "Fixed" centering (exteraGram-style): always sit at the screen's true horizontal
+            // midpoint, sized to content but NOT clamped against leftDefault/rightDefault's real
+            // back-button/menu edges the way the default branch above is - it can overlap a wide
+            // back button or a busy menu on narrow headers. That's the accepted tradeoff.
+            final int pillWidth = Math.max(dp(48), Math.min(width, chatAvatarContainer.getTitlesWidth() + getCenteredTitlePillPadding()));
